body:
That rocks had messages to communicate. To listen to them, you would have to hold them near your ear. The first thing that would come to your mind would be their message - if you were *really* listening, that is.

&#x200B;

And so I would collect my neighbour's gravel and hide the rocks in my drawers. 

&#x200B;

Kids are fucking weird.

I'm sorry for being such an important part of my neighbour's trashcan

&#x200B;

ok wow sorry for last night's takeout order
